reference/QuestsInvestigations/

# Progression Framework + Seafarer (worked-example dependent) mod zips and decompiles,
# used to investigate soft-dependency support parallel to vsquest (proprietary; scratch,
# never committed)
reference/ProgressionInvestigations/

# The Almanac: Illuminated + Trades/Callings/Mastery mod zips and decompiles, used to check
